#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:35
msgid "The short version"
msgstr "The short version"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:36
msgid ""
"We process your statement only to convert it, delete the raw PDF "
"immediately, purge previews after about one hour, and never sell your "
"data or use document content to train models."
msgstr ""
"We process your statement only to convert it, delete the raw PDF "
"immediately, purge previews after about one hour, and never sell your "
"data or use document content to train models."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:40
msgid "1. Uploaded documents"
msgstr "1. Uploaded documents"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:41
msgid ""
"When you upload a PDF, we store it temporarily in a private upload "
"directory so the parser can read it. The file is removed in a guaranteed "
"cleanup step immediately after extraction, including when parsing fails. "
"The extracted rows are held in the database for approximately one hour to"
" support the editable preview and downloads, after which the payload is "
"purged. We do not use your document content for advertising or model "
"training."
msgstr ""
"When you upload a PDF, we store it temporarily in a private upload "
"directory so the parser can read it. The file is removed in a guaranteed "
"cleanup step immediately after extraction, including when parsing fails. "
"The extracted rows are held in the database for approximately one hour to"
" support the editable preview and downloads, after which the payload is "
"purged. We do not use your document content for advertising or model "
"training."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:43
msgid "2. Account data"
msgstr "2. Account data"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:44
msgid ""
"If you register, we store your email address, optional full name, a "
"salted password hash, plan tier, quota counters, billing-cycle dates, "
"preferred interface language and account creation time. We never store "
"plaintext passwords. If you create API keys, we store a short display "
"prefix and a keyed hash, never the full key."
msgstr ""
"If you register, we store your email address, optional full name, a "
"salted password hash, plan tier, quota counters, billing-cycle dates, "
"preferred interface language and account creation time. We never store "
"plaintext passwords. If you create API keys, we store a short display "
"prefix and a keyed hash, never the full key."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:46
msgid "3. Usage data"
msgstr "3. Usage data"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:47
msgid ""
"To enforce quotas we record the number of pages converted, the associated"
" account (if any), a one-way salted hash of the client IP address and a "
"timestamp. We do not store the raw IP address in the usage log. This data"
" is used for rate limiting, abuse prevention and aggregate service "
"metrics."
msgstr ""
"To enforce quotas we record the number of pages converted, the associated"
" account (if any), a one-way salted hash of the client IP address and a "
"timestamp. We do not store the raw IP address in the usage log. This data"
" is used for rate limiting, abuse prevention and aggregate service "
"metrics."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:49
msgid "4. Cookies and local storage"
msgstr "4. Cookies and local storage"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:50
msgid ""
"We use a small number of essential cookies: a signed session cookie for "
"language choice and sign-in state, and a remember-me cookie if you select"
" that option. We do not use advertising cookies. Static assets may be "
"served by a CDN, which receives standard request metadata."
msgstr ""
"We use a small number of essential cookies: a signed session cookie for "
"language choice and sign-in state, and a remember-me cookie if you select"
" that option. We do not use advertising cookies. Static assets may be "
"served by a CDN, which receives standard request metadata."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:52
msgid "5. Sharing and processors"
msgstr "5. Sharing and processors"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:53
msgid ""
"We use infrastructure and content-delivery providers to host and serve "
"the application. They process data only on our instructions and under "
"appropriate safeguards. We may disclose information if required by law or"
" to protect the service and its users. We do not sell personal data."
msgstr ""
"We use infrastructure and content-delivery providers to host and serve "
"the application. They process data only on our instructions and under "
"appropriate safeguards. We may disclose information if required by law or"
" to protect the service and its users. We do not sell personal data."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:55
msgid "6. Retention"
msgstr "6. Retention"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:56
msgid ""
"Raw uploaded PDFs: deleted immediately after extraction. Parsed preview "
"payloads: approximately one hour. Usage logs and conversion history: "
"retained while needed for quota enforcement, account history and legal "
"obligations. Account data: retained until you delete your account or ask "
"us to erase it, subject to legal retention requirements."
msgstr ""
"Raw uploaded PDFs: deleted immediately after extraction. Parsed preview "
"payloads: approximately one hour. Usage logs and conversion history: "
"retained while needed for quota enforcement, account history and legal "
"obligations. Account data: retained until you delete your account or ask "
"us to erase it, subject to legal retention requirements."

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:58
msgid "7. Your rights"
msgstr "7. Your rights"

#: app/templates/main/privacy.html:59
msgid ""
"Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to access, correct, "
"export or erase personal data, object to or restrict processing, or "
"withdraw consent. To exercise these rights, contact us. You may also "
"lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority."
msgstr ""
"Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to access, correct, "
"export or erase personal data, object to or restrict processing, or "
"withdraw consent. To exercise these rights, contact us. You may also "
"lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority."

